# AddressSanitizer suppressions for the macos-asan build (CMakePresets.json).
# Only third-party or system code goes here (ASan can only suppress reports
# raised inside an interceptor: interceptor_via_fun / interceptor_via_lib).
# Every entry has its reason above it.
#
# No entries: the full suite with the game data produced no AddressSanitizer
# reports.
